1.1. URL Shortener service


2.Feature
Ask question from the interviewer.
a.How long a tiny url would be ? Will it ever expire ?
b.Can a customer create a tiny url of his/her choice or will it always be service generated ?
c.If user is allowed to create customer shortened links, what would be the maximum size of custom url ?
d.How many url shortening request expected per month ?
e.Do we expect service to provide metrics like most visited links ?

